Enabling usage capture will:
  1. Register <REPO>/hooks/usage-capture.ts
     on the AfterModel event(s), in <HOME>/.gemini/settings.json
     as a direct node command (no shell wrapper; needs Node.js 24 or later when the hook fires):
       node "<REPO>/hooks/usage-capture.ts" gemini-cli AfterModel
  2. Back up <HOME>/.gemini/settings.json first when it exists, and change no other entry in it
  The capture script is wired in place, by its in-repo absolute path; it is never copied.
  No prompt or response text is recorded: only token counts, model and timing.
  MemPalace is not required: records go to the file-system usage journal.

